.SH NAME
gyro-s3-alerts-get - Fill alert of a bucket


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro s3 alerts get   [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Fill alert of a bucket

.PP
Threshold, state and current usage of one bucket. A \fBfill alert\fP sends one e-mail to the account address when a bucket's usage reaches the threshold: \fBpercent\fR = a share of the package size (every bucket of the service shares the package) or \fBgb\fR = an absolute size. Checked every 5 minutes. After the e-mail the alert is \fBtriggered\fR; it re-arms when usage drops below 95% of the threshold, and the next crossing sends again. The alert only informs, uploads are not stopped. The package-wide 80% / 100% e-mails stay as they are. Object Storage and Protected Storage (old versions and delete markers count as usage).

.PP
API: GET /cloud/storage/{id}/buckets/{bucket}/alert (operationId getStorageBucketAlert, scope services_read)


